{"5084200":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Task Bar Cube","steam_appid":5084200,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5280220,5280250,5280270],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Task Bar Cube – Idle RPG on Your Taskbar<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task Bar Cube is a desktop idle RPG and clicker that lives on your taskbar. Keep it open as a small window while you work, or play it fullscreen. Your heroes fight on their own, even while you're away. Collect gear in 7 rarities, from Common to Divine, with 7 tiers for every item. Climb the weekly <strong>Online Ranking<\/strong> and prove you're the best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn real Steam items just by playing.<\/strong> Every 5 minutes of play gives you a Steam chest, and every item inside can be sold on the Steam Community Market. Chest drop rates: Lv.1 85% · Lv.2 10% · Lv.3 3% · Lv.4 1.5% · Lv.5 0.5%.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/extras\/d66b16b4e838c441ff8c487ef8b0f9b5.poster.avif?t=1793266742\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/extras\/d66b16b4e838c441ff8c487ef8b0f9b5.webm?t=1793266742\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/extras\/d66b16b4e838c441ff8c487ef8b0f9b5.mp4?t=1793266742\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Gear &amp; Grow Your Village<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fusion:<\/strong> Fuse items into new gear.<\/li><li><strong>Gem Socketing:<\/strong> Add gems for extra stats.<\/li><li><strong>Rarity &amp; Tier Upgrade:<\/strong> Push your gear to the top.<\/li><li><strong>Hunting, Farming &amp; Mining:<\/strong> Gather resources while you work.<\/li><li><strong>Merchant:<\/strong> Trade your ores for rewards.<\/li><li><strong>Library &amp; Animal Shelter:<\/strong> Boost your heroes and pets.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Team for a Battle That Lasts Years<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Heroes &amp; Pets:<\/strong> Build the team you want, pick your strategy. Five classes, each with its own combat skill.<\/li><li><strong>Talent Tree &amp; Hero Skills:<\/strong> Shape every hero your way.<\/li><li><strong>Cube Upgrade:<\/strong> Hundreds of upgrades with no cap, plus Prestige.<\/li><li><strong>Endless Levels:<\/strong> No level cap, no end.<\/li><li><strong>ACT League:<\/strong> Beat rival bosses for bonuses that stay even after Prestige.<\/li><li><strong>Story, Quests &amp; Achievements:<\/strong> 8 chapters, daily quests and Steam Achievements.<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Task Bar Cube – Idle RPG on Your Taskbar<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task Bar Cube is a desktop idle RPG and clicker that lives on your taskbar. Keep it open as a small window while you work, or play it fullscreen. Your heroes fight on their own, even while you're away. Collect gear in 7 rarities, from Common to Divine, with 7 tiers for every item. Climb the weekly <strong>Online Ranking<\/strong> and prove you're the best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn real Steam items just by playing.<\/strong> Every 5 minutes of play gives you a Steam chest, and every item inside can be sold on the Steam Community Market. Chest drop rates: Lv.1 85% · Lv.2 10% · Lv.3 3% · Lv.4 1.5% · Lv.5 0.5%.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/extras\/d66b16b4e838c441ff8c487ef8b0f9b5.poster.avif?t=1793266742\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/extras\/d66b16b4e838c441ff8c487ef8b0f9b5.webm?t=1793266742\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/extras\/d66b16b4e838c441ff8c487ef8b0f9b5.mp4?t=1793266742\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Gear &amp; Grow Your Village<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fusion:<\/strong> Fuse items into new gear.<\/li><li><strong>Gem Socketing:<\/strong> Add gems for extra stats.<\/li><li><strong>Rarity &amp; Tier Upgrade:<\/strong> Push your gear to the top.<\/li><li><strong>Hunting, Farming &amp; Mining:<\/strong> Gather resources while you work.<\/li><li><strong>Merchant:<\/strong> Trade your ores for rewards.<\/li><li><strong>Library &amp; Animal Shelter:<\/strong> Boost your heroes and pets.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Team for a Battle That Lasts Years<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Heroes &amp; Pets:<\/strong> Build the team you want, pick your strategy. Five classes, each with its own combat skill.<\/li><li><strong>Talent Tree &amp; Hero Skills:<\/strong> Shape every hero your way.<\/li><li><strong>Cube Upgrade:<\/strong> Hundreds of upgrades with no cap, plus Prestige.<\/li><li><strong>Endless Levels:<\/strong> No level cap, no end.<\/li><li><strong>ACT League:<\/strong> Beat rival bosses for bonuses that stay even after Prestige.<\/li><li><strong>Story, Quests &amp; Achievements:<\/strong> 8 chapters, daily quests and Steam Achievements.<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Task Bar Cube is an idle RPG playable either in full screen or directly from your taskbar. Upgrade your characters and pets, collect rare equipment, and discover dozens of different progression systems.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Catalan","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/19d1511760b052a6fa697a47dacf58965be2a59e\/header.jpg?t=1793266742","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/f231038be7eb8fe5a322301194c6a5ba3fd4675f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793266742","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/f231038be7eb8fe5a322301194c6a5ba3fd4675f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793266742","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 730<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2120<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 740<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":[" DarkRook Interactive"],"publishers":[" DarkRook Interactive"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5084200\/5d36093673d200c8f